-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party software

SDR-Kit does not bundle third-party programs. The installer downloads and
builds them on the Raspberry Pi, each under its own license — among them
OpenWebRX+ (AGPL-3.0), rtl-sdr, rtl_433, dump1090-fa and multimon-ng (GPL-2.0),
codec2 (LGPL-2.1) and Tailscale (BSD-3-Clause). The optional digital-voice
decoder (DSD-FME + mbelib) is covered by the licenses in its own repositories and
implements patented AMBE/IMBE vocoders; see docs/legal.md before enabling it.
